<title>ITALY: Price set at 100.65 at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Price set at 100.65 at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a new first tranche of 3.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a reduced first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1, 2004 CCT</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   5.92 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 6.79 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price	100.65</p>
<p>    Total bids	  4.789 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    3.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous CCT auction on December 30 was for a seventh tranche of 3.8 percent, Nov 1 2003 CCTs which gave a net yield of 6.09 percent, gross yield 6.98 percent and were assigned at 100.35.</p>
</text>
